{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLOpus\/version"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The document-attributes attribute group is used to specify the attributes for an entire MusicXML document."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Currently this is used for the version attribute."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"version","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL11MXLDocumentV","text":"MXLDocument","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLDocument"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL11MXLDocumentV7VersionV","text":"Version","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLDocument\/Version"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The version attribute was added in Version 1.1 for the score-partwise and score-timewise documents. It","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"provides an easier way to get version information than through the MusicXML public ID. The default value is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"1.0 to make it possible for programs that handle later versions to distinguish earlier version files reliably.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Programs that write MusicXML 1.1 or later files should set this attribute.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Maps to the MusicXML ","type":"text"},{"code":"version","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" attribute.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlopus\/version"]}],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"property",